  triage:title "Delivery-contract assertions dropped from the renamed default-template test" ;
  triage:description "fenix critical design review, PR #1438 comment https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1438#issuecomment-5648340494 (2026-09-12T20:01:44Z), reviewed at b06b3e262. crates/atm-core/src/send/nudge_template.rs:291-331 replaces all_default_templates_render_and_match_their_delivery_contract and loses the assertions that <when idle=\"immediate\" is present on Delivery/DeliveryAck and absent on every other kind, and that atm read --message-id is present on the actionable kinds. Not mandated by D4/Tests; a coverage regression." ;
